lvals_ap_c
----------
l1: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ w ∊ lvals $ by weaken [#1]
l2: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ n ∊ ω $ by ax
l3: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ ap w n ∈ ω $ by lvals_ap [l1, l2]
l4: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ w = w $ by eq_refl
l5: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ n = N $ by ax
l6: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ ap w n = ap w N $ by ap_eq [l4, l5]
l7: $ G , n = N , n ∊ ω ⇒ ap w N ∈ ω $ by wcel_eq_l [l6, l3]
