l9: $ G , i ∊ ω ⇒ i = n ∨ ¬ i = n $ by excluded_middle
l10: $ G , i ∊ ω ⇒ {y | (i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w n) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w i)} = ap w i $ by or_elim [l9, l6, l8]
l11: $ G ⇒ i ∊ ω → {y | (i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w n) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w i)} = ap w i $ by imp_intro [l10]
l12: $ G ⇒ ∀ i (i ∊ ω → {y | (i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w n) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w i)} = ap w i) $ by all_intro [l11]
l13: $ G ⇒ clam i ω {y | (i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w n) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ y ∊ ap w i)} = clam i ω (ap w i) $ by clam_eq_body [l12]
l14: $ G ⇒ clam i ω (ap w i) = w $ by cpi_eta [#1]
l15: $ G ⇒ lupd w n (ap w n) = w $ by eq_trans [l13, l14]

lupd_twice
----------
l1: $ G , i ∊ ω , i = n ⇒ i = n $ by ax
l2: $ G , i ∊ ω , i = n ⇒ {z | (i = n ∧ z ∊ y) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ z ∊ ap (lupd w n x) i)} = y $ by k2_upd_eq [l1]
l3: $ G , i ∊ ω , i = n ⇒ {z | (i = n ∧ z ∊ y) ∨ (¬ i = n ∧ z ∊ ap w i)} = y $ by k2_upd_eq [l1]
