l14: $ G ⇒ d ∊ trees ω $ by and_elim_r [l12]
l15: $ G ⇒ c ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [l13]
l16: $ G ⇒ d ∈ trees ω $ by welc_wcel [l14]
