limax_one
---------
l1: $ x ∊ lvals ⇒ x ∊ lvals $ by ax
l2: $ x ∊ lvals ⇒ enc_lvl (ls lz) ∈ trees ω $ by enc_lvl_trees
l3: $ x ∊ lvals ⇒ enc_lvl a ∈ trees ω $ by enc_lvl_trees
l4: $ x ∊ lvals ⇒ lv (enc_lvl (limax (ls lz) a)) x = nimax (lv (enc_lvl (ls lz)) x) (lv (enc_lvl a) x) $ by lv_limax [l2, l3, l1]
