l29: $ x ∊ lvals , k = fv nvf (enc_nat n) , k ∊ ω , j = ap x k , j ∊ ω , y ∊ ω ∧ j = suc y ⇒ lv (enc_lvl l) x = lv (enc_lvl r) x $ by k6_lcs [#4, #5, #6, l24, l25, l28, l23, l26, l22]
